# Shell scripts run as a container ENTRYPOINT/CMD need a real LF shebang
# line - a CRLF-converted #!/bin/sh\r fails with "no such file or
# directory" at container start, discovered live: checking out this repo
# on a Windows machine with core.autocrlf=true silently corrupted
# docker/app_entrypoint.sh this way, with no error at commit or push time
# - only at container start. Force LF regardless of the checking-out
# platform's autocrlf setting.
*.sh text eol=lf
